# Speedtest / 网络测速
# Shadowrocket RULE-SET
# 用于将常见测速站流量统一分流到 SPEEDTEST 策略组
# 规则刻意偏宽，方便节点测速时无需切换全局代理

# Ookla / Speedtest
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,speedtest.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ooklaserver.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdnst.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,speedtestcustom.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,speedtest
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,ookla

# Cloudflare Speed Test
DOMAIN,speed.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,ip-api.com
DOMAIN,cp.cloudflare.com

# Fast.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fast.com

# Measurement Lab / Google NDT
